note gate-pools: uses kfdres on purpose: owner=seed/omc/tests/pools/compose-owner.sh compile=16 refusal=standalone-view. Composed by launch-a64 in gpu/amd/gate.om as om2 gpu/amd/kfd/launch/common.om gpu/amd/kfd/launch/elf.om gpu/amd/kfd/launch/device.om gpu/amd/kfd/launch/dispatch.om gpu/amd/kfd/launch/plan.om gpu/amd/kfd/launch/main.om gpu/amd/kfd/cli.om.
